    "fallback_order_file": "lib/modules/fallback.order",
    "fallback_order_lines": 47,
    "why": "v5 loaded a hand-built 40-name list with no notion of the device softdeps, so smem.ko (pre: qcom_hwspinlock) and dwc3_msm.ko (pre: phy-generic phy-msm-snps-hs phy-msm-ssusb-qmp eud) could never resolve their symbols. v6 reads modules.dep / modules.softdep at runtime; the bundled closure exists so the same chain works even without the vendor metadata (and it is the fallback order)."
